<SiteLayout
  title="Wind & Flood Insurance on the MS Coast | Rob Recio"
  description="The three-policy reality of insuring a Coast home — the Wind Pool, named-storm deductibles with real dollar math, NFIP vs private flood, and FORTIFIED savings."
